direction: right

service: |md
  **Your service**

  write rows, COMMIT

  *durable in your database*
|

engine: |md
  **Workflow engine**

  steps, retries, sendEvent

  *durable in the engine*
|

service -> engine: "send() / start()\nprotected by neither" {
  style.stroke: "#E11D48"
  style.font-color: "#E11D48"
  style.stroke-dash: 4
}

service.shape: rectangle
engine.shape: rectangle
